(7. FUTURE SCOPE) Tj T*
(Future extensions of ARAG-Lite will focus on three concrete directions:) Tj T*
(1\) Multimodal Figure & Chart Parsing: Integrating vision-language embeddings to index plots,) Tj T*
(   circuit diagrams, and confusion matrices directly from PDF page renders.) Tj T*
(2\) Hybrid BM25 + Dense Reciprocal Rank Fusion: Combining sparse keyword matching for rare) Tj T*
(   mathematical symbols and acronyms with dense semantic retrieval.) Tj T*
(3\) Interactive Voice Viva Simulator: Extending the Viva Practice module with low-latency) Tj T*
(   real-time speech recognition and spoken follow-up probing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. CONCLUSION) Tj T*
(This paper presented ARAG-Lite, an adaptive multi-agent RAG framework designed for automated) Tj T*
(research paper comprehension, presentation synthesis, and viva preparation. By combining) Tj T*
(page-aware PDF chunking, isolated ChromaDB vector collections, few-shot intent routing,) Tj T*
(and ReAct faithfulness verification, ARAG-Lite achieves 94.5% citation faithfulness and 3.2%) Tj T*
(hallucination rate while reducing token consumption by 27.2%.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(REFERENCES) Tj T*
([1] Lewis, P., Perez, E., Piktus, A., et al. \(2020\). Retrieval-Augmented Generation for) Tj T*
(    Knowledge-Intensive NLP Tasks. Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems \(NeurIPS\).) Tj T*
([2] Asai, A., Wu, Z., Wang, Y., Sil, A., & Hajishirzi, H. \(2023\). Self-RAG: Learning to) Tj T*
(    Retrieve, Generate, and Critique through Self-Reflection. ICLR 2024.) Tj T*
([3] Gao, Y., Xiong, Y., Gao, X., et al. \(2024\). Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Large) Tj T*
(    Language Models: A Survey. arXiv preprint arXiv:2312.10997.) Tj T*
([4] Yao, S., Zhao, J., Yu, D., et al. \(2023\). ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in) Tj T*
(    Language Models. International Conference on Learning Representations \(ICLR\).) Tj T*
ET
